cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Quadrotor NMPC with acados"
abstract: >-
  Real-time nonlinear model predictive control for a Crazyflie 2.x
  nano-quadrotor, built on acados and simulated in PyBullet. It uses a
  quaternion rigid-body model, differential-flatness references, exact
  per-rotor thrust limits and a disturbance observer for offset-free
  tracking under wind.
